And then finally
it comes up with this answer.

238
00:12:24.677 --> 00:12:27.680
That was a lot easier than running it
by hand.

239
00:12:27.913 --> 00:12:30.616
That shows how we can create an agent

240
00:12:30.616 --> 00:12:34.086
using nothing but the raw LLM API
and some Python code.

241
00:12:34.887 --> 00:12:37.556
In the next lesson,
we'll take the same agent

242
00:12:37.556 --> 00:12:40.559
and show how to implement it
using LangGraph.

243
00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:41.494
See you there.

